  "description": "Provision of one additional self-contained unit (1 x 2 bedroom) (Use Class C3) involving the construction of a hip to gable roof extension to the main roof, rear dormer extension to the main with two dormer windows to rear roof slope and&nbsp;first floor rear extension (with roof terrace). Installation of 3 roof-lights to front roof slope, a new window to the rear elevation at first floor level and two windows within the side elevation. Works include the provision of cycle parking and refuse/recycling facilities.",
